  "description": "QUALITY. COMFORT. PERFORMANCE. STYLE. E-Trekking has been one of the strongest segments in the KTM portfolio for many years. With MACINA GRAN, MACINA STYLE and MACINA TOUR, the trekking range offers three distinct characters for different riding needs – all united by the same commitment to quality, comfort and reliable performance. The MACINA TOUR features 50 mm tires for a more agile and direct riding experience. Most models are powered by the Bosch Performance Line PX, while selected versions feature the Performance Line CX. Depending on the model, 720 Wh or 800 Wh battery capacities are available, offering a broad range of options for different riding styles and requirements. All three model ranges are built around a robust aluminium frame with clean integration and modern trekking geometry. For convenient battery handling, KTM once again relies on its proven POWER TUBE TOP LOADER (PTTL) system, allowing the battery to be easily removed upwards from the downtube and just as effortlessly reinserted.",
